                  "code": "FIN_AP_LLM_TABLE_FORMAT_PROCESSOR",
                  "id": "1769508448899",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1769508448901_1",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "You are tasked to modify the table metadata based on the hints provided\n\nmetadata: {{$context.$nodes.FIN_AP_LOOP_SUMMARY_ITEMS.FIN_AP_CODE_ANALYZE_COLUMNS.$output.result}} \nhints: {{$context.$nodes.FIN_AP_LOOP_SUMMARY_ITEMS.$currentItem['formatHint']}} \n\n*** Instructions to follow\n- For each column, the value of field in metadata should not be modified. Only headerText and valueType can be modified\n- If the hint mentions the type of a column, only change the valueType to one of the allowed values.\n- Possible values for valueType are 'string | number | amount | date | link'.\n\n\nModify the json as per the hints and give modified JSON as response\nDo not add any new attributes other than the ones in original metadata, only modify the content that already is available\n\nModify the metadata JSON according to the hints and return ONLY valid JSON.\n\nSTRICT JSON OUTPUT RULES:\n- Output must be a valid JSON object.\n- Use double quotes for all object keys and string values.\n- Use colons, not equals signs.\n- Use square brackets only for arrays.\n- Do not include markdown, code fences, comments, explanations, or escaped newline text.\n- Do not add any new attributes other than attributes already present in the original metadata.\n- Only modify existing headerText and valueType values.\n- Do not modify field values.\n- Before returning, verify that the output can be parsed by JSON.parse()."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "LLM"
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "errorNodeId": "1765961014063",
                    "name": "Generate Table Format",
                    "returnType": "object",
                    "sourceCode": "let formatHintExists = $context.$nodes.FIN_AP_LOOP_SUMMARY_ITEMS.FIN_AP_CODE_CALCULATE_FORMATHINT.$output.result \nlet meta;\nif(formatHintExists){\nmeta = $context.$nodes.FIN_AP_LOOP_SUMMARY_ITEMS.FIN_AP_LLM_TABLE_FORMAT_PROCESSOR.$output \n}else{\nmeta = $context.$nodes.FIN_AP_LOOP_SUMMARY_ITEMS.FIN_AP_CODE_ANALYZE_COLUMNS.$output.result \nreturn meta;\n}\n\n\nlet columns = meta['columns']\n\nfor(let column of columns){\nif(column['valueType'] === 'amount'){\nif( !Object.keys(column).includes('currencyField') ){\ncolumn['currencyField'] = column['field'];\n}\n}\n\n \n}\n\nmeta['columns'] = columns\nreturn meta"
