            {
              "id": "1769690301510_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Format the text content by following the instructions and return the modified text\n\nContent : {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.summarizeData}} \n\n\n*** Instructions \nFor text in `content', apply formatting as instructed below\n\n* Detect monetary amounts and replace them with `{amount:<value>,currency:<CODE>}`.\n* Detect dates or date references and replace them with date format `{date:<YYYY-MM-DD>}`. \n* Replacement to date format should only be done when we have proper date with date, month and year. If only month and/or year is only present, do not use date format\n\n\nDo not add or remove sentences.\nDo not introduce new data. Only do the formatting as instructed"
